### Generate high quality anime wallpaper
POST http://localhost:5001/api/images/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "prompt": "masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed, anime naruto wallpaper with heroes in studio ghibli style, soft lighting, vibrant colors, dynamic composition, cinematic, 8k uhd, high resolution, trending on artstation, professional photography",
    "negative_prompt": "blurry, low quality, distorted, bad anatomy, bad hands, text, error, missing fingers, extra digit, fewer digits, cropped, worst quality, low quality, normal quality, jpeg artifacts, signature, watermark, username, blurry, artist name",
    "width": 1024,
    "height": 512,
    "generator_type": "fusion_brain"
}

